---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE_URL } from "../data/authors";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../data/site";

const title = "Privacy Policy";
const description =
  "What data The Honest Reviewers collects, why, and how to contact us about it.";
const updated = "2 September 2026";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  name: title,
  description,
  url: `${SITE_URL}/privacy-policy/`,
  dateModified: "2026-09-02",
};
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} jsonLd={schema}>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-10">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>This policy explains what information is collected when you visit thehonestreviewers.com, why it is collected, and what you can do about it. We keep it short because the site does not do much with your data.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 pt-4">What we collect</h2>
      <p><strong class="text-gray-900">Analytics.</strong> We use Vercel Analytics to count page views and understand which guides are read. It records the page visited, referrer, approximate country, device type and browser. It does not use cookies to track you across sites and does not build a profile of you.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-gray-900">Advertising.</strong> We display advertising through Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalised advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" class="text-[#1E90FF] font-bold no-underline hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a>, and manage cookies through your browser.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-gray-900">Affiliate links.</strong> Links to retailers carry a tracking parameter identifying us as the referrer, so a purchase can be credited to this site. The retailer, not us, sees what you go on to buy. We never receive your name, address, or payment details.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-gray-900">Email.</strong> If you email us, we keep the message so we can reply and, where relevant, correct a guide. We do not add you to a mailing list.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 pt-4">What we do not do</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent personal data. We do not require an account. We do not run a newsletter sign-up that quietly subscribes you to anything else. We do not use your email for marketing.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 pt-4">Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can block cookies in your browser, use an ad blocker, or opt out of personalised advertising at the link above — the site works either way. If you would like us to delete an email exchange, ask and we will.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 pt-4">Children</h2>
      <p>This site is intended for adults buying tools and materials, and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from them.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 pt-4">Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes materially we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 pt-4">Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy go to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`} class="text-[#1E90FF] font-bold no-underline hover:underline">{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>

      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6">This policy describes our actual practices in plain language. It is not legal advice, and if you operate in a jurisdiction with specific disclosure requirements you should have it reviewed by a lawyer.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
